WEBVTT

00:00.014 --> 00:01.674
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION. UNDERAGE
DRINKING IS STRONGLY PROHIBITED.

00:01.675 --> 00:03.343
FORCEFUL ALCOHOL CONSUMPTION AND
SHAMEFUL ACTS ARE NOT ENCOURAGED.

00:03.344 --> 00:04.970
VIEW THIS AS A COMEDY. ALL CHARACTERS
APPEARING IN THIS WORK ARE OF LEGAL AGE.

00:10.267 --> 00:13.895
<i>Let's ride out into the
highway of our youth</i>

00:13.896 --> 00:16.857
<i>Right now is always the
best of the season</i>

00:17.107 --> 00:20.527
<i>Get high on hope, as we
adults keep winning</i>

00:20.528 --> 00:24.072
<i>Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world</i>

00:24.073 --> 00:27.367
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 2

00:27.368 --> 00:29.537
<i>Ever Endless</i>

00:30.746 --> 00:32.373
<i>Ever Endless</i>

00:34.166 --> 00:35.668
<i>Ever Endless</i>

00:37.586 --> 00:38.921
<i>Ever Endless</i>

00:39.588 --> 00:44.425
<i>Mon-Tues-Weds-Thurs-Fri,
my life knows no variety</i>

00:44.426 --> 00:45.845
<i>Ever Endless</i>

00:46.220 --> 00:51.015
<i>Sat-Sun, wake up in the afternoon
with only my smartphone to surf</i>

00:51.016 --> 00:52.600
<i>Ever Endless</i>

00:52.601 --> 00:54.018
<i>All my limbs' been giving in</i>

00:54.019 --> 00:55.895
<i>Kalbi's a burden like my lumber spine</i>

00:55.896 --> 00:57.438
<i>Doing family service with irises dim</i>

00:57.439 --> 00:59.108
<i>But you know that I'll go all the way</i>

00:59.525 --> 01:02.695
<i>Glitter, shimmer,
the light's shining</i>

01:02.945 --> 01:06.489
<i>Let's give it one more chance</i>

01:06.490 --> 01:09.952
<i>Let's ride out into the
highway of our youth</i>

01:10.160 --> 01:12.955
<i>Right now is always the
best of the season</i>

01:13.205 --> 01:16.791
<i>Get high on hope, as we
adults keep winning</i>

01:16.792 --> 01:19.795
<i>Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world</i>

01:20.045 --> 01:22.171
<i>Youth is when you never...</i>

01:22.172 --> 01:23.715
<i>stop chasing your own values</i>

01:23.716 --> 01:25.341
<i>Our youth's eternal</i>

01:25.342 --> 01:26.926
<i>the color never fades with age</i>

01:26.927 --> 01:28.845
<i>Youth is when you keep...</i>

01:28.846 --> 01:30.346
<i>getting lost along the way</i>

01:30.347 --> 01:33.893
<i>Youth is Forever</i>

01:37.688 --> 01:39.857
What's wrong, Azusa-san?

01:40.024 --> 01:41.400
What about you, Iori?

01:41.609 --> 01:42.693
Well...

01:42.860 --> 01:45.445
It's summer, so I want to
let loose and have fun.

01:45.446 --> 01:48.448
I get it, I feel the same way.

01:48.449 --> 01:49.783
Really?

01:50.117 --> 01:52.745
Yeah, as a matter of fact,

01:52.995 --> 01:54.954
I want to see Nanaka's ass so badly.

01:54.955 --> 01:57.582
That's not how I'm feeling at all.

01:57.583 --> 01:59.501
So you don't want to see it?

01:59.793 --> 02:02.337
That's of course, a different story.

02:02.338 --> 02:03.296
- Ah, there's the ass.
- Do you...

02:03.297 --> 02:05.215
always see her
in her swimsuit?

02:05.216 --> 02:07.676
However, she puts on
her wet suit way too fast.

02:08.511 --> 02:10.929
I guess you'll need
to hit up the beach then.

02:10.930 --> 02:13.641
Too much trouble since
it's crowded there.

02:13.766 --> 02:14.391
- Heh?
- Huh?

02:15.017 --> 02:16.519
Tomorrow?

02:16.727 --> 02:19.897
It's a bit hard to find more than
eight people on a short notice.

02:20.147 --> 02:22.149
More than eight people for tomorrow?

02:22.399 --> 02:24.360
I wonder what's she talking about.

02:24.527 --> 02:27.195
It's a shame that you have
some urgent plans to attend to.

02:27.196 --> 02:28.863
Tomorrow, huh...

02:28.864 --> 02:31.283
Finding eight people would be hard.

02:31.408 --> 02:34.787
But it's such a rare opportunity,
I really want to try...

02:35.037 --> 02:36.747
camping on an uninhabited island.

02:37.748 --> 02:39.416
I'll try asking around.

02:41.043 --> 02:41.794
Hey you two...

02:42.670 --> 02:44.963
I'll find enough people, don't worry.

02:44.964 --> 02:45.756
Exactly.

02:50.761 --> 02:51.804
Kitahara-san.

02:52.388 --> 02:54.597
Thanks for inviting me.

02:54.598 --> 02:56.517
It's nothing, thanks for coming.

02:58.477 --> 03:00.771
All that's left
is whoever Azusa-san invited.

03:00.980 --> 03:03.816
Sorry for the wait.

03:05.317 --> 03:06.527
Oh my.

03:07.486 --> 03:09.280
Am I the last one?

03:09.446 --> 03:10.239
Ah...

03:11.323 --> 03:13.283
Eh? She came for real?

03:13.284 --> 03:15.828
It just so happens
she's on summer break.

03:16.245 --> 03:16.829
Oh?

03:17.580 --> 03:20.249
I hereby pledge
my undying loyalty to you!

03:21.166 --> 03:22.835
You're being dramatic again.

03:23.377 --> 03:24.837
Oh, a wetsuit?

03:25.129 --> 03:27.548
We aren't planning to go diving, though.

03:29.550 --> 03:31.802
GRR GRR GRR GRR...
Ohh...

03:38.225 --> 03:40.518
It's been a while since
I last swam in the ocean.

03:40.519 --> 03:42.604
Good thing it's an uninhabited island.

03:42.605 --> 03:45.566
If only we could reserve
the entire island, though.

03:46.483 --> 03:48.736
Limiting the amount of people
is good enough.

03:49.278 --> 03:51.905
Is that person Kaya Mizuki-san?

03:51.906 --> 03:53.660
Otoya-kun, you know who she is?

03:53.964 --> 03:56.327
She appeared on the cover
of a diving magazine.

03:56.577 --> 03:58.077
By the way, Kitahara-san...

03:58.078 --> 03:58.579
Huh?

03:58.787 --> 04:01.206
Doesn't it hurt for you to stay like that?

04:01.207 --> 04:02.875
I'm used to it, so it's fine.

04:03.167 --> 04:05.168
It's dangerous if the boat shakes.

04:05.169 --> 04:07.296
Y-You're right.

04:08.714 --> 04:10.925
You can continue once we get on land.

04:11.050 --> 04:12.468
I understand.

04:13.385 --> 04:15.386
Sorry for tricking you, Chisa.

04:15.387 --> 04:17.805
You can show your sincerity
by breaking some bones.

04:17.806 --> 04:19.808
Your idea of sincerity is scary.

04:20.351 --> 04:22.895
Those two get along really well.

04:23.103 --> 04:24.396
Of course they do.

04:24.563 --> 04:26.690
They are boyfriend
and girlfriend, after all.

04:27.024 --> 04:27.649
Huh?

04:27.650 --> 04:29.526
Um... about that...

04:29.527 --> 04:31.278
Huh? Were you keeping it a secret?

04:31.487 --> 04:33.155
Ah, not really.

04:33.280 --> 04:35.741
Well... Otoya-kun... The thing is...

04:36.367 --> 04:38.744
I see...

04:39.286 --> 04:40.996
That sounds great.

04:41.497 --> 04:43.164
Does it?

04:43.165 --> 04:43.874
No idea.

04:44.375 --> 04:46.918
What do you like about Kitahara-san?

04:46.919 --> 04:48.920
Eh? Ah... uhm... well...

04:48.921 --> 04:51.589
Like how being together cheers you up.

04:51.590 --> 04:53.509
Or how he's a very open person.

04:53.759 --> 04:55.719
Ah, um... that's right.

04:55.845 --> 04:57.137
Anything else?

04:57.680 --> 04:58.429
AFTER 1 MINUTE

04:58.430 --> 05:00.223
AFTER 3 MINUTES

05:00.224 --> 05:02.184
AFTER 5 MINUTES

05:02.476 --> 05:03.978
How well...

05:04.436 --> 05:06.604
How well he eats his food, I guess.

05:06.605 --> 05:07.605
I see.

05:07.606 --> 05:08.398
What else?

05:08.399 --> 05:09.859
W-What else?

05:12.570 --> 05:13.529
AFTER 5 MORE MINUTES

05:13.654 --> 05:16.656
He chews... his food very well.

05:16.657 --> 05:18.116
I see.

05:18.117 --> 05:19.826
Oh, honey.

05:19.827 --> 05:22.538
You can praise me for things
aside from eating, you know.

05:24.248 --> 05:26.833
He can do his additions.

05:26.834 --> 05:29.335
I can also do subtractions.

05:29.336 --> 05:30.753
You sure look happy.

05:30.754 --> 05:32.298
Of course, I really am.

05:32.756 --> 05:35.551
Since I really love Kitahara-san, too!

05:37.595 --> 05:40.681
You do get happy when you talk
about what you love, after all.

05:42.266 --> 05:43.559
What's wrong, Chisa?

05:44.059 --> 05:45.519
By the way, where's Kouhei?

05:45.936 --> 05:47.520
Ah, now that you mention it.

05:47.521 --> 05:48.606
Ah...

05:48.856 --> 05:51.566
He's so happy he's suffocating
and is barely alive.

05:51.567 --> 05:52.067
Huh?

05:58.616 --> 06:01.493
So this is the uninhabited island.

06:06.624 --> 06:08.917
I'm getting excited.

06:08.918 --> 06:09.834
No doubt.

06:09.835 --> 06:12.004
This location's pretty awesome.

06:12.171 --> 06:14.840
Let's start a fire
and have BBQ or something.

06:15.758 --> 06:18.677
Excuse me sir, we should
set up the tents first.

06:18.969 --> 06:20.220
There you go.

06:20.221 --> 06:22.096
Oh right, that's true.

06:22.097 --> 06:24.350
Better get all the luggage off the boat.

06:26.185 --> 06:28.854
Think he'll come back to life
with an air pump?

06:36.529 --> 06:38.112
Have you finally calmed down?

06:38.113 --> 06:40.241
My breathing should be fine now.

06:40.616 --> 06:43.034
Then hurry up and go say hi to her.

06:43.035 --> 06:44.119
Huh?

06:44.537 --> 06:46.997
Hpmm, stop spouting
such stupid garbage.

06:47.331 --> 06:48.791
You're the stupid one here.

06:49.250 --> 06:51.961
Just think for a bit
and you'll understand.

06:52.169 --> 06:55.589
If I hear her raw voice,
my essence will collapse unto itself.

06:55.798 --> 06:57.716
What exactly is she to you?

06:58.008 --> 07:00.760
How do you expect me to talk to her?

07:00.761 --> 07:02.054
Is that so?

07:02.179 --> 07:03.806
Then I'll go say hi by myself.

07:04.807 --> 07:06.516
Try to one-up me, and I will kill you.

07:06.517 --> 07:08.727
You really are a pain in the ass.

07:09.061 --> 07:10.353
Let's go together then.

07:10.354 --> 07:12.146
I'm not mentally prepared.

07:12.147 --> 07:14.149
Eh? Huh? Hey...

07:14.483 --> 07:15.108
Huh?

07:15.109 --> 07:16.569
Where're Maya-san and the others?

07:16.861 --> 07:19.195
Ah, if you're looking for the girls,

07:19.196 --> 07:21.115
they're in the tent
getting changed already.

07:23.868 --> 07:26.035
Over there is Kaya-sama...

07:26.036 --> 07:28.455
Stop, don't imagine it, Kouhei!

07:28.789 --> 07:31.417
Chill out,
let's take some deep breaths first.

07:31.584 --> 07:32.960
Ah, yeah.

07:33.961 --> 07:35.671
Breathe in.

07:36.547 --> 07:38.090
Breathe out.

07:39.341 --> 07:40.466
Breathe in one...

07:40.467 --> 07:41.719
Ah, jeez.

07:42.761 --> 07:44.388
Oh Azusa.

07:44.597 --> 07:46.974
It's been so long since
I've seen your boobs, Maya.

07:47.349 --> 07:49.475
We've got trouble! Kouhei is dying!

07:49.476 --> 07:51.227
What's with the color of his face?!

07:51.228 --> 07:52.478
Does he have a pulse?!

07:52.479 --> 07:54.315
Kouhei!

07:55.191 --> 07:58.193
Honestly, what a waste of time.

07:58.194 --> 08:00.946
No living creature can resist such scene.

08:01.447 --> 08:04.407
Everyone has a rather
manly way of changing, huh?

08:04.408 --> 08:05.701
Don't you close the tent?

08:06.118 --> 08:07.620
Sorry to keep you waiting.

08:07.786 --> 08:08.495
Ah.

08:08.621 --> 08:10.539
Looks like you're in your swimsuits.

08:12.124 --> 08:13.333
For now, anyway.

08:13.334 --> 08:13.959
Huh?

08:21.425 --> 08:22.342
Wow.

08:22.343 --> 08:24.887
Haven't had this good
of a view since Okinawa, huh?

08:25.387 --> 08:27.890
Azusa-san, where's Kaya-sama?

08:28.224 --> 08:29.350
Yeah, she's not here.

08:29.517 --> 08:32.061
Did something happen to Kaya-sama?

08:32.228 --> 08:34.980
She wanted to go
check out the beach over there.

08:35.648 --> 08:38.067
Looks like someone's calling out to her.

08:38.359 --> 08:40.527
Someone from another group?

08:40.528 --> 08:42.487
Maybe he's hitting on her?

08:42.488 --> 08:45.908
Hitting on her, did you say?!

08:46.283 --> 08:47.910
Calm down, you simpleton.

08:48.869 --> 08:50.453
Don't worry.

08:50.454 --> 08:53.999
Even Maya can fend off a guy or...

08:54.416 --> 08:57.878
I can't believe I get to meet
someone who's been on Kohaku...

09:01.549 --> 09:02.674
Justice is served!

09:02.675 --> 09:05.177
What the hell are you doing!?

09:06.345 --> 09:07.887
That hurt!

09:07.888 --> 09:09.597
I'm so sorry.

09:09.598 --> 09:10.598
Huh?!

09:10.599 --> 09:12.518
You think apologizing
will be the end?

09:15.020 --> 09:17.398
- It's you!
- It's you!

09:18.607 --> 09:20.817
Why is Tinkerbell's president here?!

09:20.818 --> 09:22.278
That's my line!

09:22.528 --> 09:23.069
Alright!

09:23.070 --> 09:25.281
We won't bother you guys!

09:25.656 --> 09:28.325
So just go enjoy yourself
with whoever you came here with...

09:31.537 --> 09:32.246
Heh?

09:32.997 --> 09:36.584
They're all people I know!

09:41.505 --> 09:42.256
So?

09:42.548 --> 09:45.049
Why are you guys here?

09:45.050 --> 09:46.719
I should be the one asking that.

09:46.927 --> 09:49.053
You even brought Naomi with you.

09:49.054 --> 09:51.764
You have my sympathies there.

09:51.765 --> 09:52.599
Let's do this.

09:52.600 --> 09:55.518
For the sake of both ends
why don't we go our separate ways?

09:55.519 --> 09:57.187
"Separate", huh?

09:57.188 --> 09:58.646
Is there a problem?

09:58.647 --> 10:01.400
You think you'd be able
to convince her when she's like that?

10:01.567 --> 10:02.276
Huh?

10:02.526 --> 10:05.153
Do you wanna go over there
and have some fun with Onee-san?

10:05.154 --> 10:06.155
Umm, that's...

10:06.864 --> 10:07.781
Wait right there!

10:08.240 --> 10:09.991
Don't you dare lay a finger on Otoya-kun!

10:09.992 --> 10:11.285
Kitahara-san!

10:12.578 --> 10:14.662
Not just Natsumi, but Yuki too.

10:14.663 --> 10:16.873
Just how fucking horny
are your friends?!

10:16.874 --> 10:20.336
At the very least, those two
would love to stay and hang out.

10:22.296 --> 10:24.797
But you're aiming for those guys, right?

10:24.798 --> 10:26.174
Of course.

10:26.175 --> 10:27.091
They're handsome.

10:27.092 --> 10:29.260
Worthy of being my third-tier backup.

10:29.261 --> 10:31.096
What a harsh way to rate them.

10:31.514 --> 10:33.640
You guys don't mind
going somewhere else, right?

10:33.641 --> 10:34.350
Huh?

10:34.725 --> 10:36.559
You guys go have fun with your gals.

10:36.560 --> 10:38.187
Tsk, what are you saying?

10:38.646 --> 10:40.648
How can we have fun
with them being like that?

10:40.940 --> 10:42.107
That's true.

10:42.816 --> 10:45.194
Luckily, your girls
seem to be pretty good, too.

10:46.278 --> 10:48.947
So let's have fun together.

10:48.948 --> 10:50.366
Hell no.

10:50.616 --> 10:53.409
What have you been talking about?

10:53.410 --> 10:56.121
These guys want to hang out with us.

10:56.539 --> 10:58.957
Not with you guys,
but with the girls over there.

10:58.958 --> 10:59.959
Oh...

11:00.709 --> 11:02.211
I don't see why not.

11:02.419 --> 11:04.087
You sure, Kouhei?

11:04.088 --> 11:05.588
Maya-san is here too, you know.

11:05.589 --> 11:07.006
No problem.

11:07.007 --> 11:08.634
I just happened to look for...

11:08.759 --> 11:12.303
a watermelon for
watermelon splitting, you see.

11:12.304 --> 11:15.139
Oh my, that's a good idea.

11:15.140 --> 11:16.850
How in the hell is that a good idea?!

11:16.851 --> 11:17.976
Stay still!

11:17.977 --> 11:20.478
WATERMELON-KUN
Accept your fate as our watermelon.

11:20.479 --> 11:22.898
Don't use a human
for watermelon splitting.

11:23.274 --> 11:23.898
WATERMELON-KUN

11:23.899 --> 11:24.900
I'm telling you.

11:25.359 --> 11:28.195
Isn't this a waste of time?

11:28.404 --> 11:29.280
You're right.

11:29.488 --> 11:31.490
So let's decide
whether to hang out or not...

11:31.699 --> 11:33.617
through a series of matches!

11:34.285 --> 11:36.786
MATCH 1: BEACH FLAGS

11:36.787 --> 11:39.247
MATCH 2: SANDPILE BREAKING

11:39.248 --> 11:41.749
MATCH 3: BEACH VOLLEYBALL

11:41.750 --> 11:44.295
MATCH 4: SPINNING BAT RELAY

11:47.965 --> 11:50.301
We're basically
close to them at this point!

11:50.509 --> 11:52.261
Hurry the hell up and go back!

11:52.636 --> 11:55.763
But why are you so desperate about this?

11:55.764 --> 11:57.766
No, anyone would be against those guys.

11:57.975 --> 12:01.687
Don't worry,
I won't mess with your girlfriend.

12:01.979 --> 12:02.730
Hah?

12:02.938 --> 12:04.398
Huh? Girlfriend?

12:04.648 --> 12:05.524
Yeah, girlfriend.

12:05.691 --> 12:06.983
This idiot's girlfriend?

12:06.984 --> 12:07.985
That idiot, yeah.

12:08.777 --> 12:09.862
Wait.

12:10.112 --> 12:12.114
My brain can't keep up with this.

12:12.615 --> 12:14.574
You were a woman all along?

12:14.575 --> 12:15.576
- How the hell?!
- How the hell?!

12:15.951 --> 12:18.203
Then maybe one of those senpai is...

12:18.204 --> 12:19.830
Will you get off that thought already?!

12:20.039 --> 12:21.916
That guy's girlfriend is Chisa.

12:22.499 --> 12:23.959
Chisa is...

12:24.210 --> 12:26.336
the girls with
the smallest chest in your group?

12:26.337 --> 12:28.796
Compared to the rest of the group,
that's true.

12:28.797 --> 12:30.591
She's got other features too, you know.

12:30.799 --> 12:31.633
Anyway,

12:31.634 --> 12:35.179
I just want to enjoy
this uninhabited island to the fullest.

12:35.596 --> 12:37.264
Alright, alright.

12:37.389 --> 12:39.766
You're pissed
since there's no alcohol, right?

12:39.767 --> 12:42.686
Were you not listening to me just now?

12:43.145 --> 12:45.648
Then let's play Russian Mary Game.

12:45.856 --> 12:47.106
What is that?

12:47.107 --> 12:48.525
Prepare some tomato juice...

12:48.526 --> 12:51.486
and one Bloody Mary
with hot spicy tabasco mixed in.

12:51.487 --> 12:53.196
We all guess who drank it.

12:53.197 --> 12:54.615
The loser gets a penalty.

12:54.823 --> 12:56.951
Our club plays this game a lot.

12:57.117 --> 12:58.868
Sounds pretty fun, doesn't it?

12:58.869 --> 13:00.119
Sounds like it'll be a blast!

13:00.120 --> 13:01.746
Let's do it!

13:01.747 --> 13:03.374
On board already, huh?

13:03.707 --> 13:05.708
You guys like this kind of game, right?

13:05.709 --> 13:06.876
Is that all?

13:06.877 --> 13:08.254
How lame.

13:08.587 --> 13:10.547
- You have to make it water and vodka.
- You have to make it water and vodka.

13:10.548 --> 13:12.257
Has alcohol rotted your brains?

13:12.258 --> 13:13.466
The hell you say?!

13:13.467 --> 13:15.176
Not eveyone can drink that stuff!

13:15.177 --> 13:16.636
Then let's play among ourselves.

13:16.637 --> 13:17.721
Hey you.

13:18.305 --> 13:19.014
Huh?

13:19.265 --> 13:21.350
You want something easy to drink, right?

13:21.559 --> 13:22.977
No, it doesn't matter.

13:23.227 --> 13:23.935
Eh?

13:23.936 --> 13:26.480
I'm not interested in that kind of games.

13:26.689 --> 13:29.858
Come on, this is more fun
when everyone plays together.

13:29.859 --> 13:32.027
Feel free to enjoy yourselves.

13:33.237 --> 13:34.905
What's with that attitude?

13:36.240 --> 13:37.157
What attitude?

13:37.408 --> 13:41.119
You're from the dive shop, right?

13:41.120 --> 13:42.204
And?

13:42.496 --> 13:44.205
Huh? Really?

13:44.206 --> 13:45.999
So you're used to
reception type stuff.

13:46.000 --> 13:47.959
Then the way
you're acting is a bit off, no?

13:47.960 --> 13:49.586
What a buzzkill.

13:49.587 --> 13:50.838
Right?

13:51.046 --> 13:53.924
If you can't get yourself
to join this kind of activity,

13:54.175 --> 13:56.510
wouldn't that make you
a terrible shop attendant?

13:57.720 --> 13:58.888
Fine.

13:59.180 --> 14:00.931
I'll take up...

14:02.057 --> 14:03.309
your challenge.

14:03.767 --> 14:04.727
Is that so?

14:04.977 --> 14:07.228
We got her to join.

14:07.229 --> 14:08.606
That's more like it.

14:08.856 --> 14:11.317
Then I'll go get
the drinks and the Tabasco.

14:11.567 --> 14:13.026
Anything else we need?

14:13.027 --> 14:13.985
- Spirytus.
- Spirytus.

14:13.986 --> 14:15.988
- We don't have that!
- We don't have that!

14:16.947 --> 14:17.739
Kudou.

14:17.740 --> 14:18.407
Ah.

14:19.074 --> 14:20.117
Oh, Tokita.

14:20.409 --> 14:22.285
You're joining too, right?

14:22.286 --> 14:24.705
This does sound like my kind of game.

14:25.039 --> 14:26.040
But sorry...

14:26.290 --> 14:28.000
We'll have to pass this time.

14:28.834 --> 14:29.460
Huh?

14:32.171 --> 14:34.005
That was a little surprising.

14:34.006 --> 14:35.216
What was?

14:35.508 --> 14:37.384
Earlier with what Tokita senpai did.

14:37.510 --> 14:40.220
With Kaya-sama here,
it makes sense to turn them down.

14:40.221 --> 14:42.138
Well, that's might be true.

14:42.139 --> 14:43.474
What's this about me?

14:45.559 --> 14:46.936
What an engaging way to move.

14:47.645 --> 14:50.396
It's a rare chance,
try to talk to her normally.

14:50.397 --> 14:52.607
I would if I could.

14:52.608 --> 14:55.193
But there's the off chance
she ends up hating me...

14:55.194 --> 14:56.278
I see.

14:56.529 --> 14:57.737
Alright, I got it.

14:57.738 --> 14:59.114
Kitahara?

14:59.448 --> 15:01.074
I'll figure something out.

15:01.075 --> 15:03.993
Kitahara, thank you!

15:03.994 --> 15:05.453
You owe me one.

15:05.454 --> 15:07.039
I'll repay the favor
with my life.

15:08.040 --> 15:08.957
Maya-san.

15:08.958 --> 15:09.999
What's up?

15:10.000 --> 15:11.918
It's about my friend, Kouhei.

15:11.919 --> 15:13.295
Actually, a while back...

15:13.420 --> 15:15.965
he tried to take
your little sister to his room.

15:16.131 --> 15:16.841
Eh?!

15:20.344 --> 15:22.137
Say your last words.

15:23.055 --> 15:26.559
I figured I'd be easier for you
if she hated you.

15:27.810 --> 15:30.603
Oh, there are so many fish.

15:30.604 --> 15:32.313
Did you catch that much?

15:32.314 --> 15:32.814
Nah.

15:32.815 --> 15:35.609
Most of them were caught
by the senpais who dived down.

15:36.026 --> 15:38.444
I wanted to try it myself.

15:38.445 --> 15:40.113
Shall we go together tomorrow?

15:40.114 --> 15:42.616
Weren't you bad with water, Kitahara-san?

15:43.367 --> 15:45.786
I've gotten a little used to it recently.

15:45.911 --> 15:47.329
I see.

15:47.746 --> 15:50.748
I may not be good with it,
but it doesn't hurt to keep trying.

15:50.749 --> 15:53.460
Otherwise, you'll never get over it.

15:54.378 --> 15:56.755
<i>Doesn't hurt to try...</i>

15:58.966 --> 16:00.467
Let's have a taste.

16:01.302 --> 16:02.469
It's so good!

16:02.636 --> 16:03.887
It's that good?

16:03.888 --> 16:05.639
You try it too, Chisa.

16:07.349 --> 16:09.100
It really is good.

16:09.101 --> 16:10.686
I know, right?

16:10.811 --> 16:11.979
Otoya-kun, give it a try.

16:12.354 --> 16:14.106
Here, say "ahh."

16:14.231 --> 16:14.731
Huh?

16:14.732 --> 16:19.028
Ah... um... that... erm...

16:23.824 --> 16:25.826
That's a little embarrassing.

16:26.035 --> 16:28.245
Oh woops, sorry about that.

16:29.455 --> 16:31.206
The meat's been grilled!

16:31.207 --> 16:32.749
Yeah!

16:32.750 --> 16:34.710
Cheers!

16:44.845 --> 16:47.014
Now that
we've had our fill of the banquet,

16:47.556 --> 16:49.140
It's time to play some games!

16:49.141 --> 16:50.266
Wooo!

16:50.267 --> 16:53.061
How about the game
the Tinkerbell taught us?

16:53.062 --> 16:54.647
The Russian Mary one.

16:54.772 --> 16:55.981
Sounds good.

16:56.148 --> 16:59.067
Then Otoya-kun
and I will facilitate the game.

16:59.068 --> 16:59.610
Yes.

17:00.069 --> 17:03.196
Write your penalty game
on the paper and put it in the box.

17:03.197 --> 17:04.614
Got it.

17:04.615 --> 17:06.616
Now, what do I write?

17:06.617 --> 17:08.326
Can I ask a question?

17:08.327 --> 17:09.077
What is it?

17:09.078 --> 17:11.120
- Just how lewd can the penalty be?
- Just how lewd can the penalty be?

17:11.121 --> 17:11.746
Huh?

17:11.747 --> 17:14.457
I would say all facets of it are no good.

17:14.458 --> 17:17.294
<i>Isn't that usually something
the guys would ask?</i>

17:17.586 --> 17:18.836
Eh...

17:18.837 --> 17:19.837
Not even a little?

17:19.838 --> 17:20.880
Like for 5 seconds?

17:20.881 --> 17:24.260
Depending on the situation,
Imamura-san might just die, so...

17:24.552 --> 17:26.595
Kouhei-kun, what did you write?

17:27.137 --> 17:28.805
He'll die, huh?

17:28.806 --> 17:30.808
So stripping is not allowed, right?

17:31.016 --> 17:32.934
That was a little shocking.

17:32.935 --> 17:34.018
What was?

17:34.019 --> 17:37.064
I didn't expect Nanaka-san
to play these kinds of games.

17:37.356 --> 17:40.275
Well, that's what she does for her job.

17:40.276 --> 17:42.027
So that everyone can have fun.

17:42.361 --> 17:45.530
It's true that many instructors
are very good at mixing in.

17:45.531 --> 17:48.701
That means her personality
fits perfectly for an instructor.

17:48.909 --> 17:49.660
That's right.

17:52.580 --> 17:54.831
Alright everyone, pick up your glasses.

17:54.832 --> 17:56.166
Wooo!

18:02.214 --> 18:03.007
Chisa?

18:03.591 --> 18:04.717
I'm also...

18:05.217 --> 18:05.926
playing.

18:06.427 --> 18:09.138
I'm pretty good at
joining in on these things too.

18:09.638 --> 18:11.806
Okay, let's start round one.

18:11.807 --> 18:12.557
Yeah!

18:12.558 --> 18:14.226
The first penalty game is...

18:14.518 --> 18:17.188
confess to the person on your right.

18:17.646 --> 18:19.607
<i>The person on my right is...</i>

18:19.732 --> 18:21.859
<i>Well, I should be good if it's her.</i>

18:22.276 --> 18:24.736
<i>So the person confessing to me is...</i>

18:24.737 --> 18:28.199
THOOM... THOOM...

18:28.657 --> 18:30.450
Russian Mary Game!

18:30.451 --> 18:32.244
- Yeah!
- Ah!

18:34.330 --> 18:35.497
Two, three!

18:35.706 --> 18:37.708
Who got the hit?!

18:39.001 --> 18:41.462
<i>I'm so glad, just so glad!</i>

18:41.795 --> 18:43.254
Time for the penalty.

18:43.255 --> 18:45.257
Confess to the person on your right.

18:46.258 --> 18:47.718
Understood.

18:48.052 --> 18:49.011
Can you do it?

18:50.304 --> 18:51.888
Don't underestimate me.

18:51.889 --> 18:53.557
This will be a breeze.

18:54.725 --> 18:55.768
Actually...

18:56.018 --> 18:57.478
since a long time ago...

18:57.895 --> 18:59.522
and even from now on...

19:00.314 --> 19:02.066
I've always been in love with you.

19:05.277 --> 19:06.277
Oh.

19:06.278 --> 19:07.779
Quite a touching confession.

19:07.780 --> 19:09.197
My heart skipped a beat.

19:09.198 --> 19:12.826
- I... I don't think I can go on...
- There, there.

19:13.118 --> 19:15.496
Could you be any more obvious
you got the hit?

19:17.289 --> 19:20.918
I just pretended to lose
to liven up the mood.

19:21.210 --> 19:22.585
Hoho.

19:22.586 --> 19:24.420
So you won't lose once you get serious?

19:24.421 --> 19:26.506
I'm good at keeping a poker face.

19:26.507 --> 19:27.967
I see, I see.

19:28.217 --> 19:30.427
Then let's start round two.

19:30.678 --> 19:32.679
Who got the hit?!

19:32.680 --> 19:33.514
Huh?

19:36.976 --> 19:38.435
Unbalance the balance!

19:38.644 --> 19:39.937
Extinguish the sea!

19:40.396 --> 19:42.189
Swing the magical stick!

19:42.398 --> 19:45.818
Become the magical girl Lalako!

19:46.402 --> 19:47.777
So cute!

19:47.778 --> 19:49.571
Encore! Encore!

19:49.572 --> 19:50.905
I'm not doing it again.

19:50.906 --> 19:52.740
You wrote that penalty game, didn't you?

19:52.741 --> 19:55.578
I just wanted to see Kaya-sama do it.

19:55.786 --> 19:56.871
So cakey...

20:01.834 --> 20:04.712
- Let's go and find our tomorrow.
- Stop it!

20:07.214 --> 20:10.259
I'm good with
joining in these things, right?

20:10.509 --> 20:13.137
It's true that
I don't hang out with you guys as much...

20:13.596 --> 20:17.349
but I could do the job
just as good as big sister.

20:17.725 --> 20:19.267
She's completely drunk.

20:19.268 --> 20:21.478
I guess that's the end of the game.

20:21.812 --> 20:23.646
Chii-chan, what's wrong?

20:23.647 --> 20:25.441
Nothing at all!

20:25.649 --> 20:26.733
If I had to say,

20:26.734 --> 20:28.693
it's the love for the sea
that has me drunk!

20:28.694 --> 20:29.612
That's dangerous!

20:30.196 --> 20:31.446
Oh dear.

20:31.447 --> 20:32.990
What did I say?

20:34.366 --> 20:35.909
I'll go change.

20:35.910 --> 20:36.869
Gotcha.

20:37.369 --> 20:38.745
Can you go by yourself?

20:38.746 --> 20:39.787
It's fine.

20:39.788 --> 20:42.166
I sobered up
after splashing some water.

20:44.376 --> 20:46.545
I might have drunk too much.

20:47.338 --> 20:49.715
<i>Wouldn't that make you
a terrible shop attendant?</i>

20:51.050 --> 20:52.426
Even I know that...

20:53.552 --> 20:56.805
Alright, Spirytus, Spirytus.

21:07.399 --> 21:08.984
Uhh...

21:10.110 --> 21:11.779
Thank you for the feast.

21:20.287 --> 21:22.497
Calm down Chisa,
that was an accident.

21:22.498 --> 21:24.916
Leave your memories
and your life right there.

21:24.917 --> 21:28.212
If you take my memories,
what's the point of taking my life?!

21:40.015 --> 21:41.725
Oh no, don't tell me...

21:49.900 --> 21:51.527
Chisa!

21:57.241 --> 21:58.492
Ouch.

22:00.619 --> 22:02.121
Are you okay, Chisa?

22:07.585 --> 22:11.046
You again?!

22:13.007 --> 22:15.009
I feel so gross.

22:21.682 --> 22:23.224
<i>Wanna talk to you, wanna talk to you</i>

22:23.225 --> 22:25.101
<i>First I gotta know all about you,
isn't that right?</i>

22:25.102 --> 22:27.061
<i>Ending it off at round one
reeks of boredom</i>

22:27.062 --> 22:28.813
<i>Rounds two, three, and four is the plan</i>

22:28.814 --> 22:30.523
<i>As the night gets deeper,
true thoughts escape</i>

22:30.524 --> 22:32.442
<i>Let us go on and on and dive down late</i>

22:32.443 --> 22:35.445
<i>Your history, your scenery, for me
will your pages get slippery</i>

22:35.446 --> 22:37.488
<i>Hey, show me even more</i>

22:37.489 --> 22:39.240
<i>This is my track and you are
the featured guest</i>

22:39.241 --> 22:40.825
<i>We'll forget by the time when the dawn hits</i>

22:40.826 --> 22:42.285
<i>Being incomplete is perfection</i>

22:42.286 --> 22:44.537
<i>Hey, show me even more</i>

22:44.538 --> 22:46.122
<i>My mouth keeps slipping,
my mouth keeps slipping</i>

22:46.123 --> 22:47.749
<i>Complaint whether we sober upward</i>

22:47.750 --> 22:49.793
<i>For now, let's ride high on this feeling</i>

22:50.169 --> 22:56.217
<i>Let's live this moment with all we can
without leaving a single regret,</i>

22:56.717 --> 22:58.426
<i>We are gonna do it,
we go past the limit now</i>

22:58.427 --> 23:00.053
<i>Not just the whole night,
party till the sun is out</i>

23:00.054 --> 23:02.222
<i>Let's fly high</i>

23:02.223 --> 23:02.805
<i>(Let's fly high)</i>

23:02.806 --> 23:04.807
<i>So first, you just strip it down</i>

23:04.808 --> 23:07.101
<i>An exposed and feral kind of bond</i>

23:07.102 --> 23:10.730
<i>It's the way of life's cycle,
let us go way beyond</i>

23:10.731 --> 23:12.357
<i>The very moment that we met
I drop my shy act</i>

23:12.358 --> 23:14.108
<i>I wanna bare it all
and say what I need to say</i>

23:14.109 --> 23:16.111
<i>Do it now...</i>

23:16.904 --> 23:21.199
<i>This is the magic spell that breaks
down each and every single wall</i>

23:21.200 --> 23:24.661
<i>And once you get used to it,
you won't feel a thing at all</i>

23:24.662 --> 23:26.162
<i>Being without clothes is
a mystery I live in</i>

23:26.163 --> 23:27.914
<i>The drinking and chatting
is flowing more freely</i>

23:27.915 --> 23:30.292
<i>Try it now...</i>

23:30.709 --> 23:34.212
<i>And right before you realize
what's going on</i>

23:34.213 --> 23:38.425
<i>Your heart will catch right up
and finally be free</i>

23:45.015 --> 23:49.979
NEXT TIME
NOW WE'RE EVEN
